  "name": "surrealdb",
  "description": "SurrealDB is a distributed, multi-model database engine that unifies document, graph, and relational paradigms within a single scalable platform. It implements ACID transactions, real-time live queries, and a granular permissions-based security model to facilitate direct client-side integration without traditional intermediate backends. The system supports pluggable key-value backends and integrates a server-side JavaScript runtime for custom business logic execution.",
